{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">波蘭射手利雲度夫斯基，在美職的芝加哥火燄亮相。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">37歲的利雲度夫斯基上月已落實加盟火燄，這日正式亮相。他出席記者會時拿起9號球衣，亦有與隊友出席操練。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.MLS.LEWANDOWSKI-0600.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026vy2ccac7iX1784072677.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.MLS.LEWANDOWSKI-0600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">利雲度夫斯基與球會簽約兩年，他說仍然渴望奪得錦標，很開心踏出新一步，展開挑戰。他在職業生涯攻入超過700球，上季為巴塞羅那上陣46場，入19球，奪得西甲冠軍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T00:02:30.644557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}